  },
  {
    "description": "",
    "index": 183,
    "role": "AXStaticText",
    "title": "",
    "value": "My Python function needs the real password to do its job, but I want its recorded arguments and returned object to hide private fields. How can I change what Weave records without changing the function itself?"
  },
  {
    "description": "",
    "index": 186,
    "role": "AXStaticText",
    "title": "",
    "value": "just now"
  },
  {
